*_evidence.png
*_annotated.png
/Swaraj_spot-*.json

# ── Agent-generated reports / submissions at the repo root ──────────
# Written by `swarn run`; the few checked-in examples are already tracked
# and stay so — these patterns only stop new ones piling up.
/*_analysis_report.txt
/*_report.md
/submission_*.csv
/swarn_run_*.json
